BabyBus Kids Science is a science learning app launched by BabyBus officially. It covers a wide range of science topics, awesome scientific experiments and fun science games that can not only make it esay for kids to understand some scientific phenomena, but also ignite kids' interest in science.

A VARIETY OF SCIENCE TOPICS
BabyBus Kids Science covers a wide range of science topics, including contents like plants, animals, space, weather, chemistry, physics and lots more. Kids can have fun exploring this virtual science world and search for scientific truths bravely!

AWESOME SCIENTIFIC EXPERIMENTS 
BabyBus Kids Science gives kids a chance to do simple, safe and kid-friendly science experiments with common materials by touching the screen themselves. Kids' desire for scientific exploration will be satisfied as they observe the surprising reactions from the experiments!

FUN SCIENCE GAMES
Besides, each science topic includes tons of interactive games and cartoons. Simply by touching and tapping the screen, kids can follow the story lines to discover science secrets one by one and solve the scientific questions in their minds!

There are many more interesting science activities waiting for you in BabyBus' science world, so come and explore!

FEATURES:
- 15 different science topics;
- 15 simple science experiments;
- 50+ fun scenario simulation games;
- Kids get to know different animals, plants, weather phenomena and more;
- Allows kids to actively explore topics like physics, chemistry, biology, etc; 
- Supports offline mode;
- Supports to limit the amount of time your kids spend on it.

Do you want to raise a fluffy cat? Then come to this open pet cat world! Hatch surprise eggs! Feed and dress up your pet cats. Play, explore, make friends, spend holidays, and have fun with them!

GIVE BIRTH TO BABY CATS
Just put two fluffy cats into a magical merge machine, press the start button, and out pops an egg. After hatching each egg, you'll receive 28 different kittens! In DIY mode, you can even create your own unique kittens!

TAKE CARE OF YOUR PET CATS
Do you know how to take care of newborn baby cats? Feeding, bathing, potty-training them and much more. What if they get sick? Don't worry! Take them to the pet therapy room for a full checkup! What if they get hungry? Go to the kitchen and make magic desserts for them!

CREAT CAT STORIES
Let's go outside and explore! Explore the Forest, City in the Sky, Cat Town, Desert, and more! You'll meet lots of new cat friends along the way and receive new gifts! Decorate the living room, write letters inviting friends over, and you can keep creating new cat stories!

DRESS UP BABY CATS
The pet dressing room is finally upgraded! There are various pretty clothes! Which to wear, traditional suits, delicate princess dresses, or Chinese costumes? Try them all on your cat! Look, the cat is so happy in its new clothes!

PLAY WITH PET CATS
Play with the baby cat all day long! Challenge the ball maze, row the boat, push the box and more! There are many different activities for you to try. What should I do when I reach a difficult level? Don't worry! Read the walkthrough and you will be able to pass the level quickly!

Download Little Panda's Cat Game, take care of your fluffy baby animals, and grow up with them!

FEATURES:
- An open pet cat world without any game objectives or rules;
- Care for pet cats with varying appearances and moods;
- Create new cats continuously;
- Hatch surprise eggs through magic merge machine;
- Unlock multiple interactions: feeding, playing, dressing up, exploring, and making friends;
- Decorate the living room and invite your cat friends;
- 20+ types of ingredients for you to develop magic cat recipes;
- Explore the outdoors: go to the Forest, City in the Sky, Cat Town, and Desert;
- 70+ kinds of clothes and accessories for you to dress up cats;
- New events update every season and holiday.

